  "description": "What: CE-4649 part C (AN-20a/b/c/d; docs/designs/animals/DESIGN_Animals.md 4b) - on the farm terrain two hunters (Friend, the anti-drone man) are ORDERED (a Superior's PersonAttack, R-3101: an explicit order lifts the neutral and conduct holds for that target only) to fire at a lone duck and into a duck flock (one entity drawn as 30 birds), each hovering 8 m up 45 m east of its hunter ('Hunter Lone' (85,100), 'Hunter Flock' (85,200)). Judge: (1) the lone duck's health is 0 and it lies on the ground (z near 0) (2) the flock's count drops by at least one (3) the flock flees (it flies). All points are inside 0-300 m. Check: scripts/scenario-regression.sh an-duck-hunt"
